:: NightPatrol_Random {"position":"2000,925","size":"100,100"}
<<goto "NightPatrol_Start">>

:: NightPatrol_Roll {"position":"2125,925","size":"100,100"}
<<set $nightPatrolActive = true>>
<<set $nightPatrolUsedToday = true>>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = false>>
<<set $currentMode = "nightPatrol">>
<<set $timeOfDay = "night">>
<<set _place = random(1, 5)>>

<<if $danger >= 6 or $shura >= 5>>
  <<set _risk = "High">>
<<elseif $danger >= 3 or $isolation >= 4>>
  <<set _risk = "Mid">>
<<else>>
  <<set _risk = "Low">>
<</if>>

<<if _place == 1 and _risk == "Low">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol01_Low">>
<<elseif _place == 1 and _risk == "Mid">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol01_Mid">>
<<elseif _place == 1 and _risk == "High">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol01_High">>

<<elseif _place == 2 and _risk == "Low">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol02_Low">>
<<elseif _place == 2 and _risk == "Mid">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol02_Mid">>
<<elseif _place == 2 and _risk == "High">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol02_High">>

<<elseif _place == 3 and _risk == "Low">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol03_Low">>
<<elseif _place == 3 and _risk == "Mid">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol03_Mid">>
<<elseif _place == 3 and _risk == "High">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol03_High">>

<<elseif _place == 4 and _risk == "Low">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol04_Low">>
<<elseif _place == 4 and _risk == "Mid">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol04_Mid">>
<<elseif _place == 4 and _risk == "High">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol04_High">>

<<elseif _place == 5 and _risk == "Low">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol05_Low">>
<<elseif _place == 5 and _risk == "Mid">>
  <<goto "NightPatrol05_Mid">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "NightPatrol05_High">>
<</if>>

:: NightPatrol_End {"position":"2125,1050","size":"100,100"}
<<set $nightPatrolActive = false>>
<<set $nightPatrolJustFinished = true>>
<<set $currentMode = "temple">>
<<goto "AdvanceDay">>

:: NightPatrol01_Low {"position":"2300,800","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-full">
돌계단은 축축했다.

늑대는 한동안 그 아래에 멈춰 섰다.

위쪽에서 발소리가 난 듯했으나,
곧 바람뿐이 되었다.
</div>

<div class="choice-box">
<<link "귀를 기울인다" "NightPatrol01_Low_Listen_Result">>
  <<set $isolation -= 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
<<link "그냥 돌아간다" "NightPatrol01_Low_Return_Result">>
  <<set $isolation += 1>>
  <<set $helpRefusedCount += 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
<</page>>

:: NightPatrol01_Mid {"position":"2425,800","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-full">
계단 옆 벽에 손자국이 남아 있었다.

피는 마른 듯했고,
아직 젖은 듯도 했다.

위쪽 어둠에서 무언가가 숨을 삼켰다.
</div>

<div class="choice-box">
<<link "올라가 본다" "NightPatrol01_Mid_Climb_Result">>
  <<set $danger += 1>>
  <<set $isolation -= 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
<<link "흔적만 확인하고 돌아간다" "NightPatrol01_Mid_CheckTrace_Result">>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
<<link "보지 못한 척한다" "NightPatrol01_Mid_LookAway_Result">>
  <<set $isolation += 1>>
  <<set $helpRefusedCount += 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
<</page>>

:: NightPatrol01_High {"position":"2550,800","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-full">
계단 위에 병사 하나가 쓰러져 있었다.

아직 숨이 붙어 있었다.

그는 늑대를 보자,
도망치려는 대신 눈을 감았다.
</div>

<div class="choice-box">
<<link "숨이 붙어 있는지 확인한다" "NightPatrol01_High_CheckBreath_Result">>
  <<set $danger += 1>>
  <<set $isolation -= 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
<<link "지나친다" "NightPatrol01_High_Pass_Result">>
  <<set $isolation += 2>>
  <<set $helpRefusedCount += 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
<<link "끝낸다" "NightPatrol01_High_End_Result">>
  <<set $shura += 1>>
  <<set $danger += 1>>
  <<set $isolation += 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
<</page>>

:: NightPatrol02_Low {"position":"2300,950","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-full">
빈집 골목에는 아직 사람의 흔적이 남아 있었다.

문턱에는 작은 신발 한 짝.

바람이 불 때마다,
문은 안쪽에서 대답하듯 삐걱였다.
</div>

<div class="choice-box">
<<link "신발을 문 안쪽에 놓아둔다" "NightPatrol02_Low_PlaceShoes_Result">>
  <<set $isolation -= 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
<<link "그대로 둔다" "NightPatrol02_Low_LeaveShoes_Result">>
  <<set $helpRefusedCount += 1>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
<</page>>

:: NightPatrol02_Mid {"position":"2425,950","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-full">
문틈 사이로 작은 숨소리가 들렸다.

늑대가 가까이 다가가자,
안쪽에서 급히 빗장이 걸렸다.

그 소리는 칼이 뽑히는 소리보다도 작았다.
</div>

<div class="choice-box">
